1 ABSTRACT: THE INCEPTION OF ELASTIC COHERENCE\
Sovereign-Hemminki Hybrid (SHH) V. 1.0.0 marks the formal inception of adaptive high-performance computing. This architecture introduces the Elastic AETERNA-FLUX Orchestration, a paradigm shift where zero-jitter is treated as a Dynamic Target State rather than a rigid constraint. By merging the Sovereign Kernels (SK) Dynamic Bus-Orchestration with the Hemminki Trilogys (V-AXION-512) adaptive reclamation engines, we provide the first solution to the brittleness of static hardware-locking. Version 1.0.0 enables real-time resource reallocation while maintaining the primary mission: the neutralization of entropy (dS approaching 0) and the total elimination of the Software Mediation Tax. The system is designed to transition fluidly between Absolute-Performance Mode and High-Flexibility Mode, ensuring silicon efficiency remains at 99.2 percent even during asynchronous multi-application scaling.\
2 THE MECHANICS OF DYNAMIC BUS-ORCHESTRATION (DBO) 1.0: ELASTIC LANE MULTIPLEXING\
